cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this dataset or site, please cite it as below."
type: dataset
title: "UAE Streets: a bilingual field guide to the names on UAE street signs"
abstract: >-
  27 streets across the seven emirates of the UAE, each with its Arabic name,
  English transliteration, meaning, and the history behind the name. Entries are
  labelled documented (named for a recorded person, event or landmark) or local
  account (a widely told explanation with no official record).
authors:
  - name: "UAE Streets contributors"
version: "0.1.0"
date-released: "2026-10-20"
license:
  - MIT
  - CC-BY-4.0
keywords:
  - United Arab Emirates
  - street names
  - toponymy
  - onomastics
  - Arabic
  - bilingual
  - cultural heritage
